  "privacyTitle": "Privacy",
  "privacyIntro": "Troona plays the music stored on your phone. It has no account, no ads and no analytics.",
  "privacyLocalTitle": "On this device",
  "privacyLocalBody": "Your library, likes, playlists and listening history are stored only on this phone. Troona reads your audio files and never your photos, videos or documents.",
  "privacyOnlineTitle": "Online extras (off by default)",
  "privacyOnlineBody": "There are two separate switches. Bios sends artist and album names to Last.fm. Photos sends them to Deezer, with up to three titles of each artist's songs (their most played) so that the photo found is of that artist and not a namesake, and downloads pictures from Deezer or Last.fm. These services also see your IP address, as with any web request. No file, account or play count is sent. Turn either switch off at any time in Settings: requests to that service stop, and turning photos off also deletes the photos already downloaded.",
  "privacyReportsTitle": "Problem reports",
  "privacyReportsBody": "Errors are written to a log on this device. It can contain file names. Nothing is sent unless you choose Report a problem and share it yourself.",
  "privacyBackupTitle": "Backups",
  "privacyBackupBody": "A backup holds the parts you choose (playlists, likes, listening history, settings, equalizer), with the names and sizes of your music files, unencrypted. Troona writes it to the folder you picked for backups, or hands it to the app you choose when you share it. It goes nowhere else. Restoring reads only the backup you pick, and writes only the parts you keep.",
  "privacyDeleteTitle": "Deleting your data",
  "privacyDeleteBody": "Uninstalling Troona deletes everything it stored. Your music files, and backups in your backup folder or exported, are never touched.",
  "permissionHeadline": "All your music.\nNothing in the way.",
  "permissionSubhead": "Troona plays the songs already on your phone. No account, no ads, no streaming.",
  "permissionQualityTitle": "Plays what you own",
  "permissionQualityBody": "MP3, FLAC, AAC, WAV, OGG and Opus, at their original quality.",
  "permissionPrivacyTitle": "Private by design",
  "permissionPrivacyBody": "Your music stays on this device. Online extras are optional.",
  "permissionLibraryTitle": "Ready in seconds",
  "permissionLibraryBody": "Covers, albums and artists, sorted for you.",
  "permissionAllow": "Allow access",
