  "whatsNew100WeekTitle": "Your week in music",
  "whatsNew100WeekBody": "Every Monday on Home: listening time, top artist and top song, with a calendar of the days you listened.",
  "whatsNew100ReplayTitle": "Monthly Replay",
  "whatsNew100ReplayBody": "At the start of each month, your 25 most played songs of the month before become a playlist.",
  "whatsNew100SleepTitle": "Sleep timer and speed",
  "whatsNew100SleepBody": "Stop the music after 15, 30 or 45 minutes, an hour or at the end of the song, and play from 0.75x to 2x.",
  "whatsNew100QueueTitle": "Queue",
  "whatsNew100QueueBody": "See what played and what comes next. Drag to reorder, swipe to remove, undo in one tap.",
  "whatsNew100ExtrasTitle": "Artist photos and bios, your call",
  "whatsNew100ExtrasBody": "Two switches in Settings, off by default. Your music files never leave your phone.",
  "whatsNew100LibraryTitle": "Your library, offline",
  "whatsNew100LibraryBody": "Songs, albums and artists from your phone, with search across all three. Scans show their progress live.",
  "whatsNew100PlayerTitle": "Now Playing",
  "whatsNew100PlayerBody": "Swipe between covers, seek on the ring, and enjoy soft fades on play, pause and skip.",
  "whatsNew100PlaylistsTitle": "Playlists and likes",
  "whatsNew100PlaylistsBody": "Create playlists, reorder their songs, and find every song you like in one place.",
  "whatsNew100LanguageTitle": "English and French",
  "whatsNew100LanguageBody": "The whole app follows your phone's language.",
